    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know a hotline wont change the fact that he's gone. it's not just sadness, it's like... i'm just waiting for the world to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone too. everything is so gray. even the air feels heavy. it's like i'm just a ghost in this house.\n mira, its just so much easier to imagine being at peace",
