    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop of nothingness. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. sometimes i look at his side of the bed and i just think... if i could just be with him, the silence wouldn't be so heavy anymore. it feels like the only way to actually find that peace is to just... stop fighting it.\n Nos ayudajas de encontrar la salida. ilyas",
